Subject: [PATCH] Keep autonomous backhaul recovery rooted with native admission

Quiesce downstream backhaul BSSs and verify kernel link-down before every STA
reconnect. Keep configured enable separate from operational admission. Reopen
only with current-generation root proof from the native EasyMesh agent.

--- a/src/wifi_hal.c
+++ b/src/wifi_hal.c
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
